                                        "entry_id": "7227f43f-1c4c-3451-9b17-c7c4dd24260d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Alternative spelling of paddleboat."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "alternative"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ebb9a8b8-1067-4da5-bd1e-878c95cccfd5",
                                                "sense_id": "5cfe698d-b696-3e50-86d7-adb08bc642b0",
                                                "text": "Perhaps the most interesting of all the recent additions to the Clyde fleet is Talisman, built in 1935 for the London & North Eastern Railway, for in her are incorporated entirely new features in that she is a paddle boat driven by diesel-electric engines."
